# ﾍﾙﾌﾟ > ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報 (menu 0x9c45; AGERC dialog resource 2) on SC0000 page 1. The game holds and its frame stays frozen,
# with no dim, while the dialog is open. `dialogs` lists its title, its static texts (the icon static's template name
# SYSTEM3 first) and OK, its only button, whose id is IDCANCEL (2). OK closes it, and the game goes on from the page it
# held on. Run on a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-version-dialog.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 1.5
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=20
wait 1
click newgame.begin
wait-state top=SC0000@0x83f timeout=60  # page 1
settle

menu version
wait 1.5
dialogs                                 # ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報: SYSTEM3, ARCGameEngine, ... ; buttons OK
shot version-dialog
answer OK
wait 1
dialogs                                 # none
expect top=SC0000@0x83f
advance                                 # the game goes on
expect top=SC0000@0x874                 # page 2
